    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"a way out\"? what does that even mean? you talk like it's some kind of relief, but everything feels so heavy and pointless. i keep thinking that if the foundation is gone, then the whole structure is just... broken beyond repair. it feels like i'm just waiting for the rest of it to collapse.",
